  kind: 10
  description: 'A solar observatory at the L1 point between Kestrel and Thalassa, 27.6 km sunward of the planet, where the pulls of the star and the planet balance and it goes round with Thalassa. L1 is unstable: it drifts off, faster and faster, unless it fires its thrusters, every few minutes. A 600 m sunshield, and a telescope in its shadow.'
